  "description": "Conversion of garage to habitable room, Replace garage door with window in front elevation, Single storey side extension, Alterations to garage roof to raise height&nbsp;",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposal, by reason of the site being located within an area of land liable to\r\nflooding and the lack of a comprehensive Flood Risk Assessment, including a lack\r\nof flood maps and flood mitigation measures which take into account local\r\nsurface water flood maps and data, has failed to demonstrate that the proposed\r\ndevelopment would not exacerbate the risk of flooding within the site or\r\nincrease the risk and consequences of flooding elsewhere, contrary to the\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies SI12 and SI13 of The London\r\nPlan (2021), Core Policy CS1.U of Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and Policies DM 9\r\nand DM 10 of the Harrow Development Management Polices Local Plan (2013).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
